      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "たくさんの土人形が現れ僕を包囲した。\nそして奥からバタバタという足音と共に、\nひとりの少女が姿を現す。",
      "jp_sha256": "6342b4cd58282fe8f8d948ea3d39fd14d5f2dc7fe6ec802142dee41455b3e05a",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "수많은 흙 인형이 나타나 나를 포위했다.\n그리고 안쪽에서 다급한 발소리와 함께\n한 소녀가 모습을 드러냈다.",
      "message_index_0based": 7,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 18,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b001-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "128938e9b3dd3049f3aa60206b141356e9ff3929a1d9ab7676e4add205694beb:000002_7710498014771699374:g0:r17",
      "row_index_0based": 17,
      "serialized_row_index": 17,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "たくさんの土人形が現れ僕を包囲した。\nそして奥からバタバタという足音と共に、\nひとりの少女が姿を現す。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "8e6b0b772cc6d77c5bae4022ff18eeca937a962343d4e2654518cbaed2ac7e5d",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 8,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "私の秘密工房に侵入してくるとは、いい度胸だね。\n返り討ちにしてあげ……って、\nえ、ご主人！？",
      "jp_sha256": "9dd2d8a6f3715040ab2e7d94342ee7ad808ba5ef9f3032d96bfec792364ced17",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "내 비밀 공방에 침입하다니 배짱도 좋구나.\n혼쭐을 내 주…… 잠깐,\n어, 주인님!?",
      "message_index_0based": 8,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 30,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b001-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "Stage B 원문 대조에서 의미·문체·표기 교정.",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "128938e9b3dd3049f3aa60206b141356e9ff3929a1d9ab7676e4add205694beb:000002_7710498014771699374:g0:r29",
      "row_index_0based": 29,
      "serialized_row_index": 29,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "ペトラ",
        "Emt2_Ang",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "私の秘密工房に侵入してくるとは、いい度胸だね。\n返り討ちにしてあげ……って、\nえ、ご主人！？",
        "",
        "ch_10012/R18/10012A0_10012_Nml/10012A0_10012_001",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "ペトラ",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": "ch_10012/R18/10012A0_10012_Nml/10012A0_10012_001"
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "ba2a3e5a702b88fc7775d43680b5e12b79782cc3a5371b720cf0bc5bcbec7c6e",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 9,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ど、どど、どうして君がここに？\nわ、私作業中だったから手とか服とか汚れてるし、\nち、ちちち、ちょっと水浴びしてきていいかな？",
      "jp_sha256": "eb7f93a696c1f7610e4b13b3c5f77bfa41808a11a610c061f55c7de3f231addd",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "어, 어어, 어떻게 네가 여기에?\n나, 작업 중이라 손이랑 옷도 더럽고,\n자, 잠깐 씻고 와도 될까?",
      "message_index_0based": 9,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 32,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
